      <section class="story-section" data-scroll-group data-scroll-step="90">
        <h2>Search turns the whole site into one navigable space</h2>
        <p>
          Search looks across the site&rsquo;s indexed pages and returns relevant passages together with their original
          locations. A visitor can begin with a company, a project, a place, or a broader question without having to
