        <p>
          <AiAskTerm /> uses the same retrieval layer to select passages that can support the question. It sends those
          passages together with the question to the generation service through Cloudflare. The language model forms
          an answer from that material and attaches citations to the passages it uses, so the reader can move from the
          answer back into the site.
        </p>
        <p>
          This is retrieval-augmented generation, or RAG. Retrieval determines which parts of the site are available
